to ensure it's properly set up to expose metrics, but since the previous query for Redis also didn't return data, maybe the Redis instance isn't configured to expose metrics either.\n\nBut since the user is focusing on the email service's metrics issue, the next logical step is to check the email service's deployment or service manifest to see if there's a metrics endpoint. They could use kubectl to describe the deployment or service and look for any annotations or ports related to metrics. Alternatively, they might need to check the application's code or configuration to see if it's supposed to expose metrics on a specific path and port. If the email service isn't instrumented, that could be the root cause of the missing metrics, which in turn might be related to the long duration observed in the send_email span. If the email service isn't properly monitored, it could be causing delays or errors that aren't being captured in the traces, leading to the observed issues.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl describe -n astronomy-shop deployment email"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b5a373accaa816cc', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 505, 'prompt_tokens': 12233, 'total_tokens': 12738, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe60-960e-7f40-99d3-71237fd9505d-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl describe -n astronomy-shop deployment email'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b5a373accaa816cc', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 12233, 'output_tokens': 505, 'total_tokens': 12738}), ToolMessage(content="Name:                   email\nNamespace:              astronomy-shop\nCreationTimestamp:      Wed, 18 Mar 2026 00:34:06 +0000\nLabels:                 app.kubernetes.io/component=email\n                        app.kubernetes.io/managed-by=Helm\n                        app.kubernetes.io/name=email\n                        app.kubernetes.io/part-of=opentelemetry-demo\n                        app.kubernetes.io/version=2.2.0\n                        helm.sh/chart=opentelemetry-demo-0.40.4\n                        opentelemetry.io/name=email\nAnnotations:            deployment.kubernetes.io/revision: 1\n                        meta.helm.sh/release-name: astronomy-shop\n                        meta.helm.sh/release-namespace: astronomy-shop\nSelector:               opentelemetry.io/name=email\nReplicas:               1 desired | 1 updated | 1 total | 1 available | 0 unavailable\nStrategyType:           RollingUpdate\nMinReadySeconds:        0\nRollingUpdateStrategy:  25% max unavailable, 25% max surge\nPod Template:\n  Labels:           app.kubernetes.io/component=email\n                    app.kubernetes.io/name=email\n                    app.kubernetes.io/version=2.2.0\n                    opentelemetry.io/name=email\n  Annotations:      resource.opentelemetry.io/service.namespace: otel-demo\n  Service Account:  astronomy-shop\n  Containers:\n   email:\n    Image:      ghcr.io/open-telemetry/demo:2.2.0-email\n    Port:       8080/TCP (service)\n    Host Port:  0/TCP (service)\n    Limits:\n      memory:  100Mi\n    Environment:\n      OTEL_SERVICE_NAME:                                   (v1:metadata.labels['app.kubernetes.io/component'])\n      OTEL_COLLECTOR_NAME:                                otel-collector\n      OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_METRICS_TEMPORALITY_PREFERENCE:  cumulative\n      EMAIL_PORT:                                         8080\n      APP_ENV:                                            production\n      OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT:                        http://$(OTEL_COLLECTOR_NAME):4318\n      FLAGD_HOST:                                         flagd\n      FLAGD_PORT:                                         8013\n    Mounts:                                               <none>\n  Volumes:                                                <none>\n  Node-Selectors:                                         <none>\n  Tolerations:                                            <none>\nConditions:\n  Type           Status  Reason\n  ----           ------  ------\n  Available      True    MinimumReplicasAvailable\n  Progressing    True    NewReplicaSetAvailable\nOldReplicaSets:  <none>\nNewReplicaSet:   email-56985bb4f8 (1/1 replicas created)\nEvents:\n  Type    Reason             Age    From                   Message\n  ----    ------             ----   ----                   -------\n  Normal  ScalingReplicaSet  3m48s  deployment-controller  Scaled up replica set email-56985bb4f8 to 1\n", id='071d29b2-fb91-417c-afd3-91d52ab4b1ee', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b5a373accaa816cc'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='85cce6ae-d2ff-48dc-8e43-a1fc231ce9a7')]]
